{"match":{"matcher":"quote-matcher-v1","receipt_ref":"f9ab0e56-9d4d-5a28-85d9-ef9c4fb0c230","status":"exact"},"paper_id":"paper:a956ab5c-d99b-5373-801b-5de0aaceb360","passage_id":"passage:89c5de57-fdc2-53e0-918a-f51c155487cc","producer_ids":{"evidence_ref":"4f9e3214-6909-503c-bd10-a6580e6cfe4e"},"quote":"Animals at 3 mg/kg and all animals at 5 mg/kg doses required the administration of atipamezole to survive. The reported values reflect combined data (two females + two males per group; total= 4).","quote_sha256":"sha256:8ff44ac1d2107f20dee16c8d8b3c24d9a52dddfb02e9e4acfb18d9928d03703e","quote_state":"included","source":{"end":3134,"snapshot_ref":"8f4a53b9-8924-5d00-abd3-d5fc70174ed1","start":2939,"view_id":"05cd67c7-9334-5245-8936-e3cb10548edd"}}
{"match":{"matcher":"quote-matcher-v1","receipt_ref":"368df407-8e8d-5dd5-b1b5-280a8b4b3af8","status":"exact"},"paper_id":"paper:a956ab5c-d99b-5373-801b-5de0aaceb360","passage_id":"passage:906b5ae2-e0eb-5209-ab3d-dddcc7aac776","producer_ids":{"evidence_ref":"aad6cf1b-70d4-5c6e-b6fc-0ee933cb9236"},"quote":"Fentanyl (Fentanyl Kalceks, 500 µg/10 mL, Kalcex, Riga, Latvia) was administered at three doses (0.052, 0.104, and 0.130 mg/kg) to separate groups (2 males and 2 females per dose). For confirmatory purposes, additional rats were tested in groups where overdose was consistently observed: the 0.104 mg/kg group (dose selected for the main study) was expanded with 6 additional males and 6 females; the 0.130 mg/kg group received 1 additional male and 1 female.","quote_sha256":"sha256:a890ef751b4cc22d01a5a0bab084109e5410732a5abf3276fb0cc8fccfb80330","quote_state":"included","source":{"end":2283,"snapshot_ref":"8f4a53b9-8924-5d00-abd3-d5fc70174ed1","start":1824,"view_id":"05cd67c7-9334-5245-8936-e3cb10548edd"}}
{"match":{"matcher":"quote-matcher-v1","receipt_ref":"5e2fd9d0-6650-5ca4-af18-7aa8f5e76c3a","status":"exact"},"paper_id":"paper:a956ab5c-d99b-5373-801b-5de0aaceb360","passage_id":"passage:94a5e7be-5a95-5823-a295-dc370084be11","producer_ids":{"evidence_ref":"ac20b594-a315-5c51-be1f-988143958aa6"},"quote":"To determine the optimal xylazine dose for inducing overdose, a single ascending dose study was performed in 20 rats. Xylazine (Xilazin Bio 2%, 20 mg/mL, Bioveta a.s., Ivanovice na Hané, Czech Republic) was administered at five doses (0.13, 0.39, 1, 3, and 5 mg/kg) to separate groups (2 males and 2 females per dose).","quote_sha256":"sha256:43929a47d521d9468b379cab6c9f1923946940711ffce54ff1a810bfad7f6d6f","quote_state":"included","source":{"end":1639,"snapshot_ref":"8f4a53b9-8924-5d00-abd3-d5fc70174ed1","start":1321,"view_id":"05cd67c7-9334-5245-8936-e3cb10548edd"}}
