{"match":{"matcher":"quote-matcher-v1","receipt_ref":"c9901fd2-1906-5d18-8b8d-5825e03de03b","status":"exact"},"paper_id":"paper:a956ab5c-d99b-5373-801b-5de0aaceb360","passage_id":"passage:a0351fd8-d50c-53f7-bcdf-3634d8a31a3c","producer_ids":{"evidence_ref":"924a4636-2646-5640-bf24-f308db3ea274"},"quote":"With FT alone, overdose onset occurred at ~3200 s (low), 360 s (medium), and 150 s (high), as shown onC. The reported values reflect combined data (two females + two males per group; total= 4).","quote_sha256":"sha256:9575c311eeb9cf6d21469378d3a79feaf7e6883722f7e96b8d5deb6de88e311c","quote_state":"included","source":{"end":3667,"snapshot_ref":"8f4a53b9-8924-5d00-abd3-d5fc70174ed1","start":3474,"view_id":"05cd67c7-9334-5245-8936-e3cb10548edd"}}
{"match":{"matcher":"quote-matcher-v1","receipt_ref":"9a4ffa0c-d81b-5dc8-848f-f771c77f9f60","status":"exact"},"paper_id":"paper:a956ab5c-d99b-5373-801b-5de0aaceb360","passage_id":"passage:a3269395-2b22-50bf-abb1-7066df0b8146","producer_ids":{"evidence_ref":"0221ca58-c644-5cec-a79c-ae2756932bf1"},"quote":"The main study (A) included six active treatment groups, each consisting of 5 males and 5 females, receiving NX (0.20 mg/kg), NX90 (0.26 mg/kg), ½NX + NB (0.10 + 0.10 mg/kg), NX + NB (0.20 + 0.10 mg/kg), ½NX90 + NB (0.13 + 0.10 mg/kg), or NX90 + NB (0.26 + 0.10 mg/kg). In addition, the positive control NX group and the negative control ‘no-antidote’ group each consisted of 7 males and 7 females, providing larger reference cohorts for between-group comparisons.","quote_sha256":"sha256:524627d72af61128fb7db1f3fe5e115800ce4738482efe8bf72ce7bfefd5c192","quote_state":"included","source":{"end":2776,"snapshot_ref":"8f4a53b9-8924-5d00-abd3-d5fc70174ed1","start":2312,"view_id":"05cd67c7-9334-5245-8936-e3cb10548edd"}}
